      "piece-n"
    ],
    "note": "**Part** is the general word for anything less than the whole: *part of the cake*, *the first part of the film*. **Section** is a part with clear edges, usually one of several planned parts: *the sports section*, *Section B of the test*. **Piece** is a part that has been broken, cut, or taken away: *a piece of cake*."
